  "description": "Onyun’s goal is to open an SM play cafe. While looking to take over a shuttered escape room business, he ends up trapped inside an Egyptian themed room. When he opens his eyes, he has possessed the body of a pharaoh. He soon discovers that the original owner of the body has been enjoying SM play with slaves in his harem.\n\nIf this is not hitting the jackpot, then what is?\n\nTito, a slave perfectly suited to his tastes, is a flawless masochist. Muev, a long-haired handsome acolyte priest, is a thrilling sadist.\n\n“Please let me suck on my master’s toes…”  \n“Isn’t that just a hole obsessed with cock, if you are shoving it into a perfectly fine priest?”\n\nAh, whatever. If I can’t choose, I’ll just enjoy them both.\n\n---\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3885005667), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000085008), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=921037397)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3885043343), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/BLteukgang_5gyosi), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/pharaoh_toe), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077301), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14000069)",
